WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,440
I know you feel wronged

2
00:00:01,720 --> 00:00:03,360
But Zhou Guangqian did nothing wrong

3
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:04,840
Why are you torturing him?

4
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:06,000
I torture him

5
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:09,340
There are my people in those snake skins

6
00:00:09,340 --> 00:00:10,660
I have my wife and daughter

7
00:00:10,860 --> 00:00:12,780
When they pulled the snake scarf and skinned the snake,

8
00:00:12,780 --> 00:00:14,620
Have you ever thought about what will happen today?

9
00:00:14,940 --> 00:00:17,580
Before Zhou Guang, he dug out these things just to sell them.

10
00:00:17,580 --> 00:00:19,180
He's going to see the money after selling out

11
00:00:19,180 --> 00:00:20,820
Will they still massacre us?

12
00:00:21,530 --> 00:00:23,730
What do you want to do with this bag of snake skins?

13
00:00:24,720 --> 00:00:25,960
My son is getting married

14
00:00:26,120 --> 00:00:28,400
I thought I had a bag of snake skins left at home

15
00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:29,720
Sell to raise some money

16
00:00:29,720 --> 00:00:31,000
Who knew if it was kept for too long?

17
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:32,080
It breaks as soon as it is ground

18
00:00:32,080 --> 00:00:33,800
Have you ever thought about circumcision again?

19
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:34,800
Don't dare

20
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:36,240
I have the heart but also the courage

21
00:00:36,240 --> 00:00:37,840
Enemies cannot understand each other

22
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:39,520
Did he have any thoughts of circumcision?

23
00:00:39,680 --> 00:00:40,880
Don’t you know yourself?

24
00:00:41,480 --> 00:00:42,600
I can let him go

25
00:00:42,720 --> 00:00:44,560
But I have three conditions first

26
00:00:44,680 --> 00:00:46,320
Can only eat meat raised at home

27
00:00:46,320 --> 00:00:47,560
Do not touch the outside marriage salary

28
00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:49,760
Touch a little, smell a little, give you a headache and a strong desire.

29
00:00:49,760 --> 00:00:52,160
Offer him three green incense sticks on a piece of food

30
00:00:52,160 --> 00:00:53,240
It's hard. It's all hard.

31
00:00:53,240 --> 00:00:55,520
Even if I am a vegetarian for the rest of my life, it will be fine

32
00:00:55,720 --> 00:00:58,560
Your house will not be harvested in the third year, but it is not allowed to be abandoned.

33
00:00:58,560 --> 00:01:00,840
We should cultivate Mangxian as usual

34
00:01:01,320 --> 00:01:02,320
That place is our family

35
00:01:02,320 --> 00:01:03,720
something to live on

36
00:01:03,720 --> 00:01:04,680
This is no harvest

37
00:01:04,680 --> 00:01:06,280
How do we live?

38
00:01:06,280 --> 00:01:07,680
Three years is too long

39
00:01:07,680 --> 00:01:10,000
If you want to go too far with something, then this is it

40
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:10,920
I'll heal the leg

41
00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:12,000
No more swollen, dirty and rotten

42
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:13,320
But it will be missing for three years

43
00:01:13,320 --> 00:01:15,080
It's cloudy and rainy, so my legs can't move.

44
00:01:15,080 --> 00:01:17,520
This big county is showing mercy

45
00:01:17,520 --> 00:01:20,090
Legs will feel better in three days

46
00:01:20,090 --> 00:01:21,250
The skin of the tongue is buried alive

47
00:01:21,250 --> 00:01:23,060
Not exchangeable for money

48
00:01:23,060 --> 00:01:24,100
Sister Mang got upper body once

49
00:01:24,100 --> 00:01:25,180
It's really thin enough for me

50
00:01:25,180 --> 00:01:26,620
Don’t drink while driving

51
00:01:26,620 --> 00:01:28,600
Let’s have tea instead of wine today

52
00:01:28,600 --> 00:01:30,800
I wish you peace and success in the future

53
00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:36,630
If you don't understand anything in the future, please come to me. This belongs to our master and apprentice.

54
00:01:36,630 --> 00:01:38,300
Last meal

55
00:01:38,300 --> 00:01:39,420
from today

56
00:01:39,420 --> 00:01:40,620
I'm out of school
